    <string name="welcome_title">sannu wa ylih</string>
    <string name="welcome_intro">ylih yana riƙa yadda haka kula-kula ta tsaya haɗe, don a nan gida na gida ka iya amsa tambaya ɗaya gida: sawun kaliru ne na karkama?</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_auto_title">haɗe kuma sakaci</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_auto_body">an riƙa kula-kula bluetooth ta kansu, daga lokacin da ta haɗe. babu abin da ke buƙatar jira.</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_lifetime_title">jimla ɗaya, waje gida</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_lifetime_body">lokacin da kula-kula ta mutu, dakatar da ita: jumlorin ta tsaya a nan kuma sabo na sabuwar na’ura ɗaya yana farawa daga sifili.</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_title">mabuda kuma wasa</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_body">binciken zuriya a saita yana ƙari kula-kula mabuda da uke lokaci wasa. amma kula-kula bluetooth ake riƙa haba.</string>
    <string name="welcome_privacy">komai yana zauna a jiyya. babu akawun kuma ba na’ura ita internet izini.</string>
    <string name="welcome_start">fara</string>
    <string name="welcome_next">gaba</string>
    <string name="welcome_allow">ba da izin</string>
    <string name="welcome_step">mataki %1$d na %2$d</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_title">buɗin bluetooth</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_why">android na gida yana gida na’ura bluetooth da ta haɗe, kuma menene aka kira, sai a na’ura yi riƙa izini bluetooth. shi ne ylih ta nemo kula-kula daga wuta waja, kuma ita ce tare shine.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_with">tare: kowane jimla ake riƙa daga lokacin da ta haɗe, babu abin da jira kuma babu abin da ke buƙatar tuki.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_without">ba tare: babu kula-kula bluetooth da ake riƙa ko kaɗai. komi na na’ura ya aiki yanzu, kuma ka iya ba da izini a gida android saita.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_title">sanarwa</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_why">binciken zuriya yana tare dabbar a gida, kuma android na buƙata kowane na’ura yana tare ta ajiye sanarwa da ta gida wajen yana aiki.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_with">tare: sanarwa ta nuna abin da ake riƙa a yanzu, wanda ne sigina gida ita ce binciken zuriya sai tsini.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_without">ba tare: binciken zuriya a tare riƙa kuma riƙa. android ba kaɗai ba tare sanarwa.</string>
    <string name="hibernation_title">ci gida ƙidaya wajen ka sakaci</string>
    <string name="hibernation_body">android yana tsayar na’ura wajen ba a buɗe lokaci kaɗai kuma yana dawo da izinin, wanda zai bar ylih riƙa babu komai sai wajen ka buɗe. dalilin nan ne na na’ura nan, don ya wajabe bugaje jiya.</string>
