    <string name="settings_detailed_title">binciken bayyananne</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_body">yana ƙari kula-kula mabuda da lokaci wasa. android na gida wired plug events kaɗai kaɗai wajen na’ura yana aiki, don haka ita tare sanarwa a shade. bluetooth ake riƙa haba.</string>
